296-- reusable signal-strength review -> `Learning-signal review memo`
297-- mid-execution quality gate -> `Quality iteration checkpoint memo`
298:- approval-sensitive execution -> `HITL approval packet` or `Plan approval checkpoint artifact`
299-- MCP reuse or operator handoff -> `MCP capability handoff memo`
300-- A2A lifecycle-aware collaboration -> `A2A task-handoff memo`
--
307-- assembled prompt replay runner-state verdict -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
308-- assembled prompt replay suite summary -> `Replay suite verdict memo`
309:- governance-owned packet-floor audit or omission-sensitive review -> `Packet compliance report`
310-- versioned replay suite or benchmark cohort definition -> `Benchmark registry memo`
311-- context-pack sufficiency or stale-context review -> `Context sufficiency review memo`
--
320-- adaptation lifecycle and rollback state -> `Adaptation lifecycle state memo`
321-- route-switch and re-prioritization audit -> `Route re-prioritization audit memo`
322:- engineering proof packet with executed-vs-unexecuted state -> `Coding proof bundle memo`
323:- integrated promotion packet with confidence class -> `Release evidence bundle v2`
324-- telemetry trend and cohort-aware drift review -> `Telemetry trend memo`
325:- benchmark cohort identity and run-linkage packet -> `Benchmark cohort manifest`
326:- replay execution-sheet and runner linkage packet -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
327:- context substrate scoring packet -> `Context substrate scorecard`
328:- critique delta and no-gain logging packet -> `Critique delta ledger`
329:- adaptation controller audit packet -> `Adaptation controller audit packet`
330:- route-switch benchmark packet -> `Route-switch benchmark verdict`
331:- coding execution-ledger packet -> `Coding benchmark execution ledger`
332-- promotion-grade release record -> `Release promotion decision record`
333-- telemetry-triggered drift investigation -> `Telemetry drift investigation memo`
--
345-- Tool Use / MCP -> `PROMPT_tool_protocol_overlay`; prefer `Tool capability contract / precondition memo` or `MCP capability handoff memo`
346-- Memory / Learning / Adaptation -> `PROMPT_memory_adaptation_overlay`; prefer `Memory scope / checkpoint profile memo`, `Learning-signal review memo`, and `Adaptation decision memo`
347:- Goal / Monitoring / Recovery / HITL -> base prompts; prefer `Goal-monitoring status memo`, `Recovery / escalation checkpoint memo`, and `HITL approval packet`
348-- Retrieval / RAG -> `PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay` + `grounded-research`; prefer `Evidence target / retrieval-mode memo` or `Source consultation ledger`
349-- Resource-Aware Optimization -> base prompts plus `PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay`; prefer `Resource budget and route-choice memo`
