356-- Guardrails / Safety -> `PROMPT_guardrails_safety_overlay`
357:- Evaluation / Monitoring -> `PROMPT_evaluation_monitoring_overlay` + `eval-ops`; prefer `Benchmark registry memo`, `Guide reflection benchmark memo`, or `Prompt-stack release review`
358-- FAQ / system-prompt components, prompt leakage, testability, and trajectories -> base prompts plus `PROMPT_guardrails_safety_overlay`, `PROMPT_evaluation_monitoring_overlay`, and examples; keep `Role and Goal`, `Capabilities / Tools`, `Constraints / Guardrails`, `Execution Process`, trajectory artifacts, mock-tool checks, and leakage prevention explicit
